WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.100
One folder.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.000
One folder. Your vault.

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.500
One folder. Your vault. Room to think.

4
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.100
Everything lives in one folder of plain files.

5
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:12.400
AI keeps it organized for you.

6
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.300
It files notes. It never rewrites them.

7
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:21.030
Work in views, arranged however you want.

8
00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:25.430
Same files underneath. Nothing moves.

9
00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:35.700
Plain Markdown that renders as you type.

10
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.300
Mark a note secure.

11
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:41.500
Cloud AI never sees it. Not even the title.

12
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:48.570
Chat with the AI you already pay for.

13
00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:53.230
It answers from your notes.

14
00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:58.030
Browse your vault like you browse Finder.

15
00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:04.230
Remove a note from a view.

16
00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:07.630
It stays in your vault.

17
00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:10.230
Delete moves it to Trash.

18
00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:13.630
Rotli never erases a file.

19
00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:16.030
Built for you. And for your AI.

20
00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:19.130
rotli — Room to think. Files you keep. Mac beta in preparation. rotli.co
